<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>AppiumBooster - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/AppiumBooster/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:40:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/AppiumBooster/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>打造心目中理想的自动化测试框架（AppiumBooster）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-ideal-app-automation-test-framework/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Sep 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-ideal-app-automation-test-framework/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="前言"&gt;&lt;span&gt;前言&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%89%8d%e8%a8%80" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;做过自动化测试的人应该都会有这样一种体会，要写个自动化demo测试用例很容易，但是要真正将自动化测试落地，对成百上千的自动化测试用例实现较好的可复用性和可维护性就很难了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台 (4)：自动化测试代码⎡工程化⎦</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-refactor-testcase-scripts/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 Jul 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-refactor-testcase-scripts/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在本系列的&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/"&gt;上一篇文章&lt;/a&gt;中，我通过系统登录这一典型功能点，演示了编写自动化测试脚本的整个流程，并对测试脚本进行了初步优化。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在本文中，我将重点介绍如何对自动化测试脚本实现⎡工程化⎦的组织和管理。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="测试脚本工程化"&gt;&lt;span&gt;测试脚本⎡工程化⎦&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e6%b5%8b%e8%af%95%e8%84%9a%e6%9c%ac%e5%b7%a5%e7%a8%8b%e5%8c%96" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;首先说下什么是测试脚本的工程化。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Introduction to AppiumBooster</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Introduction-to-AppiumBooster/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 Jul 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Introduction-to-AppiumBooster/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="appiumbooster"&gt;&lt;span&gt;AppiumBooster&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#appiumbooster" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;AppiumBooster helps you to write automation testcases in yaml format or csv tables, without writing a snippet of code.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台（3）：编写iOS自动化测试脚本</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;通过前面三篇文章，我们已经将iOS自动化功能测试的开发环境全部准备就绪，也学习了iOS UI控件交互操作的一般性方法，接下来，就可以开始编写自动化测试脚本了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台（1）：模拟器中运行iOS应用</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-Appium-inspector-iOS-simulator/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-Appium-inspector-iOS-simulator/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在上一篇文章中，我对本系列教程的项目背景进行了介绍，并对自动化测试平台的建设进行了规划。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在本文中，我将在已准备就绪的iOS自动化测试环境的基础上，通过Appium调用模拟器运行iOS应用。内容很是基础，熟悉的同学可直接略过。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台（0）：背景介绍和平台规划</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-backgroud-introduction/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-backgroud-introduction/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;最近新加入某项目组（以下均已M指代），需要从零开始搭建功能自动化测试平台。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>